Handbook of Mineralogy — Anthony, Bideaux, Bladh, and Nichols (@mp-handbook: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mp-sources) { r_10TEF3RSN7XFMKTGYGY4WR3P85
John W. Anthony, Richard A. Bideaux, Kenneth W. Bladh, and Monte C. Nichols, editors. Handbook of Mineralogy, Mineralogical Society of America. [Authorized species summaries and explanatory guide](https://handbookofmineralogy.org/).

Read the full explanatory page and the complete species entries used in a study, following their primary references. Distinguish measured, calculated, inferred-by-analogy, and unreported properties; preserve sample, method, composition, and conditions. A one-page property summary supports identification and research but does not teach every method producing the data.

Freely readable species PDFs are supplied. Preserve actual copyright and component notices; no blanket open-adaptation licence is established here. Editorial identity, summary structure, attribution, and authorized access checked on 29 October 2026. Use selected entries as references rather than storing a mineral catalogue in the repository.

